  "prefLabel": "Mec 501.01 Initial Plumbing and Fuel Gas Fitting Licensure Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 501.01 Initial Plumbing and Fuel Gas Fitting Licensure Fees. The fee for an initial plumbing or fuel gas fitting license shall be as specified in Plc 1002.25.\n\nSource. #10849, eff 7-1-15; (formerly Saf-Mec 501.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 500); ss by #14401, eff 10-15-25, EXPIRES 10-15-35",
